config/shader_cache/

# Runtime data
data/detail/
data/region_maps/
data/eq_client
data/captures

# Recorded sessions / packet captures for replay-oracle tests (Batch R).
# Never checked in: contains real server/account traffic. Golden replay
# snapshots generated alongside them are also local-only.

# Agent working directory
.agent/
third_party/irrlicht-gles2-x86/
build-gles2/

# Q01 (repo hygiene): benchmarks/pi_runs/ used to be gitignored here
# (H04-era), which is how P05's "committed" CSVs silently never landed
# (salvaged 3fb85fc, see refactor/deferred.md "Repo hygiene"). Unignored so
# unit deliverable CSVs can never silently vanish again -- commit each unit's
# artifacts explicitly; do not mass-add pre-existing untracked run dirs.

# SQLite transient sidecar files -- never commit these (see below)
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
